# A three-store alternates chain (s3 borrows from s2, s2 from s1) holding every
# object in s1 alone, the layout and depth the real kernel trees use. Resolution
# by full id and by 7-hex prefix plus the blob read must chase the chain to its
# end. References never cross an alternates boundary, so this fixture resolves
# no reference names.
bin: GITREAD_UNIT
args: alternates-recursive
exit: 0
